--Cursor on Brick = Cursor choose grey. You should have a real Local Gui script because this has NO RELOAD CURSOR!
--This shows the playername in hint format, too. Works great with this leaderboard together.
--This is made by Alextomcool. I did just edit it. He make great add-Ons for weapons. Look at his site and pick some up!

